{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_0.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure-filled worlds of Eldrador are in danger! Lead battle-ready creatures in turn-based strategic combat to defeat a mysterious shadowy menace.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" />What to expect:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_2.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 TACTICAL DEPTH: Freeze the opponent first? Push them into an obstacle? Or use your flame breath to roast multiple enemies at once? Use a range of accessible tactics to outsmart your opponent.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_1.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 GRIPPING BATTLES: Explosive attacks with spectacular effects make the meticulously crafted world of Eldrador quake.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_3.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 FANTASTICAL WORLDS: Explore four diverse, open locations: the seething-hot Lava World, the dangerously cold Ice World, the indestructible Stone World and the overgrown Jungle World.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_4.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 HUMOROUS STORY: Join quirky characters through over 100 levels in a light-hearted tale brimming with charm and humour.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_5.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 MIGHTY CREATURES: Assemble your favourite team of 20 creatures. Each creature has unique skills and grows stronger with every battle.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Difficulty_EN.jpg?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 EASY TO LEARN, HARD TO MASTER: Easy for children and newcomers to the genre to pick up, while also offering a challenge to experienced gamers, thanks to the adjustable difficulty level.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_VollAufDieOhren.jpg?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A FEAST FOR THE EARS: Fully voiced in English and German, with a thrilling soundtrack by Tim Grathwohl.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Schleich+Eldrador_V2.jpg?t=1744788535\" />\u2022 \u2022 \u2022 MADE IN GERMANY: Based on the popular Eldrador\u00ae Creatures toys by schleich\u00ae.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_CreatureGuide.jpg?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 DIGITAL CREATURE GUIDE: No microtransactions, no additional DRM, no Season Pass - but there is a free, 21-page Creature Guide in PDF format as an extra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What are you waiting for? Eldrador depends on you!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Eldradueler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/97f40feaab5100cdeade39bc37c7effc7f52b7ee.jpg"},{"name":"Master Eldradueler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/d39a2b1cfdd8877c50966ec543bbd30dc12701a6.jpg"},{"name":"Mini Mauler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/420a3ed7ae65e44789e302788b8bb5a35a2f3b05.jpg"},{"name":"Uneasy Alliance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/d39e84d668b42fa2f2ca3c5972cff5bb950af3e0.jpg"},{"name":"Mana-Hungry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/2d2eb35cec2129ff2a6ada0c7c848557ad2eea25.jpg"},{"name":"Last Creature Standing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/e8439861760449dfe466d403f1cdd53fba4361eb.jpg"},{"name":"Totally Fired Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/c87ef505f67576af7049a65f851d4eb826e7cb55.jpg"},{"name":"Very N-ice!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/2931702c1a4b0f9c528dda408f3e4a3b305ad4c4.jpg"},{"name":"Poison Running Through Your Veins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/f704a94e0218b2833ea607d74b7d74b65b18eae2.jpg"},{"name":"Proper Pyromaniac","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2932770/962fec89c0b4353138fd0f2d236764578c603818.jpg"}],"total":48},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2932770?t=1744788535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744788535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744788535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744788535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3645060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_0.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure-filled worlds of Eldrador are in danger! Lead battle-ready creatures in turn-based strategic combat to defeat a mysterious shadowy menace.\u00a0<img class=