\u2022 HUMOROUS STORY: Join quirky characters through over 100 levels in a light-hearted tale brimming with charm and humour.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStore_GIF_5.gif?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 MIGHTY CREATURES: Assemble your favourite team of 20 creatures. Each creature has unique skills and grows stronger with every battle.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Difficulty_EN.jpg?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 EASY TO LEARN, HARD TO MASTER: Easy for children and newcomers to the genre to pick up, while also offering a challenge to experienced gamers, thanks to the adjustable difficulty level.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_VollAufDieOhren.jpg?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A FEAST FOR THE EARS: Fully voiced in English and German, with a thrilling soundtrack by Tim Grathwohl.\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Empty.png?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_Schleich+Eldrador_V2.jpg?t=1744788535\" />\u2022 \u2022 \u2022 MADE IN GERMANY: Based on the popular Eldrador\u00ae Creatures toys by schleich\u00ae.\u00a0  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/extras/SteamStorePage_CreatureGuide.jpg?t=1744788535\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 DIGITAL CREATURE GUIDE: No microtransactions, no additional DRM, no Season Pass - but there is a free, 21-page Creature Guide in PDF format as an extra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What are you waiting for? Eldrador depends on you!</p>","developers":["Wild River Games GmbH"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932770/header.jpg?t=1744788535","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"ELDRADOR\u00ae CREATURES SHADOWFALL \u00a92024 Wild River Games GmbH. Developed and Published by Wild River Games GmbH. \u00a92024 Schleich GmbH. Licensed by BAVARIA MEDIA LICENSING.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257081615,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081615/movie480.mp4?t=1736945774","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081615/movie_max.mp4?t=1736945774"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257081615/5c110f9f41004d2106caca72ad1b20632dc791b1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1736945774","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081615/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1736945774","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257081615/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1736945774"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257071625,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257071625/mo